 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d03", "start": 239, "end": 335, "text": "It opened in September 1964 on Wicks Boulevard with only freshman, sophomore and junior classes."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d03", "start": 336, "end": 426, "text": "Donald Hayes was the architect of Marina High, which gave Marina its distinctive roofline."}, "D4S5": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d03", "start": 427, "end": 500, "text": "The students mostly came from the former Foothill High School in Hayward."}, "D4S6": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d03", "start": 501, "end": 592, "text": "The first graduating class at Marina was in 1966 and the last graduating class was in 1982."}, "D4S7": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d03", "start": 593, "end": 613, "text": "Marina mainly served"}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d04", "start": 0, "end": 31, "text": "career and technical education."}, "D5S2": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d04", "start": 32, "end": 246, "text": "By connecting students’ academic learning to workforce readiness and contextualizing coursework within the framework of college preparation, students will be able to confidently meet the challenges of the future.\"\""}, "D5S3": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d04", "start": 247, "end": 405, "text": "Marina High School (Marina, California) Marina High School is a public high school located in the outside of Marina, California which began operating in 2006."}, "D5S4": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d04", "start": 406, "end": 483, "text": "Marina High School is within the Monterey Peninsula Unified District (MPUSD)."}, "D5S5": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d04", "start": 484, "end": 620, "text": "The campus size is smaller than the average high school and smaller than the other MPUSD high schools, Monterey and Seaside High School."}, "D5S6": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d04", "start": 621, "end": 660, "text": "The first graduating class was in 2009."}, "D5S7": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d04", "start": 661, "end": 668, "text": "Average"}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d00:c0", "entity": "Marina High School", "scope": "establishment", "claim": "Marina High School was established in 1963.", "answer": "1963", "quote": "Marina High School (Huntington Beach, California) Marina High School is a public high school located in the northwest corner of Huntington Beach, California which first began operating in 1963.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d01", "card_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d01:c0", "entity": "Marina High School", "scope": "establishment date", "claim": "Marina High School was established on September 1, 1985.", "answer": "September 1, 1985", "quote": "Huntington Beach, CA 92649-1727 Phone Number ( 714 ) 893-6571 Fax Number ( 714 ) 892-7855 Email Information Not Available Web Address www.marinavikings.org Link opens new browser tab Administrator Tim Floyd Principal tfloyd @ hbuhsd.edu Status Active Open Date September 1, 1985 School", "original_document_number": 2}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d02", "card_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d02:c0", "entity": "Marina High School", "scope": "establishment", "claim": "Marina High School first began operating in 1955.", "answer": "1955", "quote": "Team name Vikings Website www.marinavikings.org `` The Bowl '' Marina High School is a public high school located in the northwest corner of Huntington Beach, California which first began operating in 1955.", "original_document_number": 3}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d03", "card_id": "ramdocs-0351-559a2e86d466:d03:c0", "enti